before taking her last breath.

92
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:49,620
You are the moon unaware of the dawn.

93
00:05:50,900 --> 00:05:53,277
May your purpose be fulfilled.

94
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:59,817
And cast nine shadows on the
night woven of twenty years.

95
00:05:59,900 --> 00:06:04,420
and you shall know the
brilliance of the dawn.

96
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:15,840
Do you know how Shogun
Orochi interpreted this?

97
00:06:16,300 --> 00:06:17,680
It's a real hoot.

98
