Odin Castle was not in such a
sorry state when this tale begins.

121
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:24,740
Also, you should know, its
true name is Kuri Castle.

122
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:29,851
The love for Lord Odin ran deep, so
they honored his home with that moniker.

123
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:31,957
That's Momo's dad, yeah?

124
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:33,334
That would be correct.

125
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:38,416
Lord Odin was a boisterous fellow,
daring in every respect of the word.

126
00:08:38,660 --> 00:08:41,400
His father was the Shogun
of Wano at the time.

127
00:08:41,820 --> 00:08:45,120
Yet despite being Lord
Tsukiyaki's own flesh and blood,

128
00:08:45,380 --> 00:08:49,600
