Indeed.

133
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,337
So Lord Odin ventured out.

134
00:09:10,420 --> 00:09:13,360
He'd outgrown his home,
calling it tiresome.

135
00:09:21,620 --> 00:09:22,600
Go to hell!

136
