Oh, I say, it's a bit stuffy around here.

172
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:23,360
For Lord Odin, the land of
Wano was a bit too small.

173
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:29,060
Those were the days.

174
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:31,520
This is it.

175
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:35,240
The very beach we washed
ashore on all those years ago.

176
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:41,240
Afraid of the unfamiliar, the locals
dubbed us talking dog and talking cat.

177
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:45,380
But Lord Odin treated us differently.

178
00:13:47,560 --> 00:13:50,120
What did they do to deserve abuse?

179
00:13:50,940 --> 00:13:54,234
Fearing those different than
you exposes your ignorance.

180
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:02,300
He was our savior.

181
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:11,460
Adored by all, highly esteemed in his
land, he charmed Roger and Whitebeard.

182
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:18,500
That man was a true hero, and
our master, a beloved treasure.

183
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:39,640
Funny, vibrant, merry, good-natured, he
was the reason why Kuri was thriving.

184
00:14:40,820 --> 00:14:44,120
It was a tragic day in Wano's history.

185
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:54,620
So what happened to Odin next?

186
00:14:56,260 --> 00:14:59,740
Tried as a criminal in
front of his people.

187
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,620
He was executed.

188
