That's messed up!

189
00:15:09,060 --> 00:15:11,280
That bastard ought to cheat!

190
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:12,820
That's cheating!

191
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,180
What a coward!

192
00:15:15,220 --> 00:15:17,040
After all that he'd done?

193
00:15:18,420 --> 00:15:19,680
How sad.

194
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:23,017
It was indeed untimely and unfair.

195
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:28,617
these events may have transpired
two decades ago but for

196
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:32,097
us it was only a few months

197
00:15:32,180 --> 00:15:37,317
a wound so fresh that every

198
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:41,197
time I close my eyes the
heartbreaking memory of that

199
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:46,100
