vividly echoes within my mind

200
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:48,110
Korya!

201
00:15:50,900 --> 00:15:53,440
What a remarkable man he was.

202
00:15:56,640 --> 00:16:00,816
It's amazing that the rest of you
guys walked away from that situation.

203
00:16:01,220 --> 00:16:02,050
Indeed.

204
00:16:02,133 --> 00:16:04,668
Our choice to make a
quick escape was clear.

205
00:16:04,820 --> 00:16:09,160
With no allies, we were only
awaiting our inevitable demise.

206
00:16:10,300 --> 00:16:15,540
We fled the execution ground and
headed straight here to Odin Castle.

207
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:24,760
Along the way, Dog Storm and Cat
Viper were caught by Orochi's men.

208
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:28,513
Forced to abandon them, we
assumed their lives were lost.

209
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:34,120
No matter which of us fell, we all
understood someone had to reach the castle.

210
00:16:35,220 --> 00:16:40,140
Orochi's next target was unquestionably
going to be the young Lord Momonosuke.

211
00:16:40,500 --> 00:16:44,220
This would be his final step
to dismantle the Kozuki clan.

212
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:55,117
No, too late.

213
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:57,517
Pace is ahead of us.

214
00:16:57,600 --> 00:17:00,660
