215
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:06,637
Damn savages.

216
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:08,357
How could you?

217
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:10,660
This won't stand!

218
00:17:12,040 --> 00:17:13,560
Seize them!

219
00:17:23,840 --> 00:17:25,220
