226
00:17:50,620 --> 00:17:51,640
Answer me!

227
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,140
This way!

228
00:17:55,500 --> 00:17:56,460
And make taste!

229
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:08,600
Lord Momonosuke!

230
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:10,620
