I must relay this news.

234
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:26,300
Despite our greatest
efforts, Lord Odin was slain.

235
00:18:26,660 --> 00:18:27,900
It's not your fault.

236
00:18:28,100 --> 00:18:30,380
You need not bear the blame. Madam!

237
00:18:30,840 --> 00:18:32,080
Lift your heads.

238
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,230
Let's leave.

239
00:18:34,520 --> 00:18:35,696
It's dangerous here.

240
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:36,861
There's no time.

241
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:39,940
No, I shall remain behind.

242
00:18:42,180 --> 00:18:43,540
Reconsider! Please!

243
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:45,337
It's not too late to flee, Lady Toki!

244
00:18:45,420 --> 00:18:46,440
I beg you!

245
00:18:49,540 --> 00:18:51,160
Then I shall stay too!

246
00:18:51,500 --> 00:18:53,853
All of us here will share the same fate!

247
00:18:54,800 --> 00:18:55,777
Leave to the future.

248
00:18:55,860 --> 00:18:56,820
Live on.

249
00:18:57,800 --> 00:18:58,720
The what?

250
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:02,540
We may lack the power needed
to return to the past.

251
00:19:02,860 --> 00:19:05,180
However, we're able to leap ahead.

252
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:11,160
By the ability of the strange
time—time fruit I ingested, I

253
00:19:11,560 --> 00:19:14,997
have been able to travel farther
and farther into the future.

254
00:19:15,080 --> 00:19:20,480
future, and I have finally arrived
here, the place where my journey ends.

255
00:19:20,940 --> 00:19:22,440
